{"asset_key":"ep8/gameplay_story_18611060","episode":"ep8","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"18611060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1861106001:1":{"text":"能够让巴登感受到过去的糖果？","source_cn":"能够让巴登感受到过去的糖果？","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF4F6F71BD3C21B9E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"249684","variant_female_record_index":"249685","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1861106002:1":{"text":"瑟恩，你还记得有一年秋夜节吗？我缠着你和巴登带我去打猎的那次。","source_cn":"瑟恩，你还记得有一年秋夜节吗？我缠着你和巴登带我去打猎...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCEE18E8A256773A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1861106003:1":{"text":"记得，那次你在森林里迷路了。","source_cn":"记得，那次你在森林里迷路了。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xCA2F9449169989BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1861106004:1":{"text":"那天你们找了我很久很久。找到我的时候，天已经黑了，我们三个都已经精疲力竭，索性就在草地上躺了下来。","source_cn":"那天你们找了我很久很久。找到我的时候，天已经黑了，我们...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x99A3C9436262A4C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1861106005:0":{"text":"巴登，瑟恩，对不起……要不是我迷了路，我们也不会都被困在这里，连秋夜节都过不了。","source_cn":"巴登，瑟恩，对不起……要不是我迷了路，我们也不会都被困...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC9E6B9F29466B30D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1861106006:0":{"text":"爱丝，这不是你的错，你不必自责。","source_cn":"爱丝，这不是你的错，你不必自责。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x9BFFB7216240E6B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1861106007:0":{"text":"秋夜节在哪里都可以过。","source_cn":"秋夜节在哪里都可以过。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xC42BFB74AF51040D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1861106008:0":{"text":"而且，要不是因为你，我们也不会发现这处绝佳的看星星的地方。","source_cn":"而且，要不是因为你，我们也不会发现这处绝佳的看星星的地方。","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xA1EDA6C775AE8DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1861106009:0":{"text":"你看天上的星星多亮，一闪一闪的，就好像只为了给我们三个人看一样……","source_cn":"你看天上的星星多亮，一闪一闪的，就好像只为了给我们三个...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF3172721E067DA87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1861106010:0":{"text":"抬头望去，密林的树梢围起了一小片夜空，夜空中没有一点乌云，深蓝的夜幕中星星亮得惊人。那是我这辈子见过最美的星空。","source_cn":"抬头望去，密林的树梢围起了一小片夜空，夜空中没有一点乌...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0xF059DA05410EDA8A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"249694","var